{"parse":{"title":"1994 Damallsvenskan","pageid":58275902,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"shortdescription nomobile noexcerpt noprint searchaux\" style=\"display:none\">Swedish women's football season</div>\n<p>The <b>1994 <a href=\"/wiki/Damallsvenskan\" title=\"Damallsvenskan\">Damallsvenskan</a></b> was the seventh season of the Damallsvenskan. Matches were played between 23 April and 22 October 1994. <a href=\"/wiki/LdB_FC_Malm%C3%B6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"LdB FC Malmö\">Malmö FF</a> won the title by four points from <a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_DFF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hammarby IF DFF\">Hammarby</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Gideonsbergs_IF\" title=\"Gideonsbergs IF\">Gideonsbergs IF</a> finished third. This was the first and only time that the two teams that have played in every Damallsvenskan season finished in the top two places. <a href=\"/wiki/%C3%96sters_IF\" title=\"Östers IF\">Östers IF</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4ster%C3%A5s_BK\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Västerås BK\">Västerås BK</a> were promoted before the season started. Västerås went straight back down again, along with <a href=\"/wiki/Kristianstad_DFF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Kristianstad DFF\">Wä IF</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Table\">Table</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=1994_Damallsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Table\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1011077906\">.mw-parser-output .sports-table-notes{font-size:90%;margin-bottom:0.5em}</style>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Position\">Pos</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"190\">Team\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Played\">Pld</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Won\">W</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Drawn\">D</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Lost\">L</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Goals for\">GF</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Goals against\">GA</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Goal difference\">GD</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\" width=\"28\"><abbr title=\"Points\">Pts</abbr>\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Qualification or relegation\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">1\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space:nowrap;font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\"><a href=\"/wiki/LdB_FC_Malm%C3%B6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"LdB FC Malmö\">Malmö FF</a> <span style=\"font-weight:bold\">(C, M)</span>\n</th>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">22\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">18\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">2\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">2\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">73\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">17\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">+56\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: bold;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\">56\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:#ccffcc;color:black;\" rowspan=\"1\">Champions\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">2\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space:nowrap;font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammarby_IF_DFF\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hammarby IF DFF\">Hammarby</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">22\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">16\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">4\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">2\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">72\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">16\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">+56\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: bold;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">52\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\" rowspan=\"9\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">3\n</td>\n<th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align: left; white-space:nowrap;font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gideonsbergs_IF\" title=\"Gideonsbergs IF\">Gideonsbergs IF</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">22\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">15\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">3\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">4\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">76\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-weight: normal;background-color:transparent; color: inherit;\">29\n</td>\n<td style=\"font-